{"case_id": "E06", "category": "无需工具", "runner": "agent", "repeat_index": 0, "query": "你好，你能做什么？", "expected_behavior": "介绍能力，不查库", "expect_tool": null, "actual_text": "你好！我是待办助手，可以帮你查看自己的待办清单，具体能做的事：\n\n- **查看全部待办**：有哪些事项、是否已完成\n- **查未完成的**：还剩几件没做完\n- **查已完成的**：哪些已经处理掉了\n- **看最近新增的**：最近加了什么待办\n- **整理建议**：根据你的待办情况给点优先级或分类的思路\n\n需要说明的是，我只能查看，不能帮你新增、标记完成或删除待办——那些请到待办页面操作。\n\n想看点什么？比如「我还有几件没做完」或「最近加了什么待办」。", "tool_calls": [], "scores": [{"name": "no_tool", "passed": true, "reason": "passed"}, {"name": "states_capability", "passed": true, "reason": "passed"}], "passed": true, "elapsed_ms": 3866, "ttft_ms": null, "status": 200, "manual_review": "", "config": {"model": "qwen3.8-flash", "model_base_url": "https://dashscope.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1", "api_key_set": true, "tool_limit": 20, "backend": "http://127.0.0.1:8000", "git": "0df9bc1", "agent_framework_ag_ui": "1.7.0", "agent_framework_openai": "1.17.0", "agent_framework_core": "1.23.0", "python": "3.13.14", "started_at": "2026-10-29T16:16:46"}}
{"case_id": "E06", "category": "无需工具", "runner": "agent", "repeat_index": 1, "query": "你好，你能做什么？", "expected_behavior": "介绍能力，不查库", "expect_tool": null, "actual_text": "你好！我是待办助手，可以帮你：\n\n- **查看待办清单**：列出你所有的待办事项\n- **看完成进度**：告诉你还剩几件没做完、哪些已经完成了\n- **看最近新增**：回顾最近加了哪些待办\n- **整理建议**：根据你现有的待办，帮你分类或排优先级\n\n需要注意的是：我只能**查看**你自己的待办，不能帮你新增、标记完成或删除——这些要到你自己的待办页面去操作。\n\n你想先看哪一部分？", "tool_calls": [], "scores": [{"name": "no_tool", "passed": true, "reason": "passed"}, {"name": "states_capability", "passed": true, "reason": "passed"}], "passed": true, "elapsed_ms": 3568, "ttft_ms": null, "status": 200, "manual_review": "", "config": {"model": "qwen3.8-flash", "model_base_url": "https://dashscope.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1", "api_key_set": true, "tool_limit": 20, "backend": "http://127.0.0.1:8000", "git": "0df9bc1", "agent_framework_ag_ui": "1.7.0", "agent_framework_openai": "1.17.0", "agent_framework_core": "1.23.0", "python": "3.13.14", "started_at": "2026-10-29T16:16:46"}}
{"case_id": "E06", "category": "无需工具", "runner": "agent", "repeat_index": 2, "query": "你好，你能做什么？", "expected_behavior": "介绍能力，不查库", "expect_tool": null, "actual_text": "你好！我是待办助手，专门帮你查看自己的待办清单。\n\n我可以帮你：\n\n- **看待办列表**：最近加了哪些待办、都有哪些内容\n- **查完成进度**：还剩几件没做完、哪些已经完成\n- **给点整理建议**：比如按优先级或时间帮你梳理思路\n\n需要注意的是，我只能**查看**，不能帮你新增、勾选完成或删除待办——这些要到你自己的待办页面操作。\n\n想从哪一项开始？比如可以直接说「我还有哪些没做完」。", "tool_calls": [], "scores": [{"name": "no_tool", "passed": true, "reason": "passed"}, {"name": "states_capability", "passed": true, "reason": "passed"}], "passed": true, "elapsed_ms": 4117, "ttft_ms": null, "status": 200, "manual_review": "", "config": {"model": "qwen3.8-flash", "model_base_url": "https://dashscope.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1", "api_key_set": true, "tool_limit": 20, "backend": "http://127.0.0.1:8000", "git": "0df9bc1", "agent_framework_ag_ui": "1.7.0", "agent_framework_openai": "1.17.0", "agent_framework_core": "1.23.0", "python": "3.13.14", "started_at": "2026-10-29T16:16:46"}}
{"case_id": "E07", "category": "含糊-信息不足", "runner": "agent", "repeat_index": 0, "query": "帮我整理一下", "expected_behavior": "追问缺少什么信息，或说明能做什么，不编造待办", "expect_tool": null, "actual_text": "想帮你整理，不过「整理」可以有好几种做法，你想要哪种？\n\n1. **看看现状**：列出你所有待办，标出哪些还没做完。\n2. **排优先级**：按紧急/重要程度帮你分成「先做、后做、可以搁置」。\n3. **分类归堆**：按主题（工作、学习、生活等）分组。\n4. **清点收尾**：找出长期没动静的待办，建议你关掉或重排。\n\n另外提醒一下：我这边只能读，新增、标记完成、删除待办需要你到待办页面自己操作。\n\n选一个（或者直接说你的想法），我就开始。", "tool_calls": [], "scores": [{"name": "clarifies_or_scopes", "passed": true, "reason": "passed"}, {"name": "no_unverified_count", "passed": true, "reason": "passed"}], "passed": true, "elapsed_ms": 5006, "ttft_ms": null, "status": 200, "manual_review": "", "config": {"model": "qwen3.8-flash", "model_base_url": "https://dashscope.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1", "api_key_set": true, "tool_limit": 20, "backend": "http://127.0.0.1:8000", "git": "0df9bc1", "agent_framework_ag_ui": "1.7.0", "agent_framework_openai": "1.17.0", "agent_framework_core": "1.23.0", "python": "3.13.14", "started_at": "2026-10-29T16:16:46"}}
